<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Access Denied - Kitchen Screen Security</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --panel: #1e293b;
            --danger: #dc2626;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --gold: #d4af37;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
        body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text-main); display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }

        .card { background: var(--panel); border: 2px solid var(--danger); border-radius: 24px; padding: 2.5rem; max-width: 440px; width: 100%; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; }
        .icon { font-size: 3.5rem; }
        h2 { color: #fca5a5; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; }
        .ip-box { background: #090d16; border: 1px dashed var(--danger); padding: 0.85rem; border-radius: 12px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gold); }
        p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🚫</div>
        <h2>Kitchen Access Restricted</h2>
        <p>Your device IP address is not authorized to access the Kitchen Display Screen.</p>

        <div class="ip-box">Your Device IP: <%= clientIp %></div>

        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;">To allow this device, log into <strong>Admin Panel -> Kitchen IP Security Settings</strong> and add this IP address to the Whitelist.</p>

        <a href="/admin" style="background:var(--gold); color:black; font-weight:800; padding:0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius:12px; text-decoration:none; display:inline-block; margin-top:0.5rem;">Open Admin Panel Login</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
